cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or derived outputs, please cite this release and the Zenodo record."
title: "Ocular-systemic genetic architecture atlas"
type: software
version: "1.1"
date-released: 2026-09-21
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code and derived outputs for a cross-trait genetic-architecture atlas
  spanning three ocular phenotypes and six systemic phenotypes. The release includes
  portable analysis scripts, frozen configuration, derived summary tables, audit reports,
  and figures. Raw GWAS summary statistics, consortium-restricted files, LD reference
  panels, and large genome-wide intermediate tables are excluded and must be obtained
  from their original providers under the applicable access and citation terms.
